                  <paragraph>Thiamine HCl Injection, USP
  <br/>
200 mg/2 mL(100 mg/mL)
 </paragraph>
                  <paragraph>For intramuscular or intravenous use.</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Protect from light.</paragraph>
                  <paragraph/>
