                  <paragraph>Each mL contains:</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Thiamine HCl, USP 100 mg;</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>chlorobutanol anhydrous (chloral derivative) 0.5%; water for injection, q.s. to 1 mL</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Sodium Hydroxide and/or Hydrochloric Acid may have been used to adjust pH between 2.5 and 4.5.
  <br/>
                     <br/>
Contains no more than 400 mcg/L of aluminum.
 </paragraph>
